  m_Text: '1. BPM is the music''s speed! Stack your combo to go faster!


    2.
    Keep hitting notes to build your combo!


    3. When a shop appears, just follow
    the arrow.


    4. Get help from supporters! Recruit them for Attack, Heal,
    or Debuff abilities.'
